{
  "name": "Go Live Notify",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## go-live-notify\n\nTriggered by MediaMTX's `runOnReady` hook (see `n8n/mediamtx/mediamtx.yml`) the instant OBS/Restream starts publishing to the EC2 RTMP server — fires for every real stream start, no manual step needed.\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Webhook receives `{ event: 'stream_started', path: 'live' }`\n2. Validates `X-N8N-Webhook-Secret` header\n3. Resolves the go-live asset (a 5-second vertical mp4 hosted on `cdn.stpetemusic.live`) + the public link (`stpetemusic.live/live`)\n4. Fans out in parallel: Facebook Page feed video post, Facebook Video Story, Instagram Video Story (link sticker) — each fails independently (`continueOnFail`) so one platform outage doesn't block the others\n\n**Required env vars (set in n8n .env):**\n- `N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET` — shared secret, must match the value deploy.yml substitutes into mediamtx.yml\n- `GO_LIVE_ASSET_URL` — public CDN URL of the 5s mp4; swap this to change the video without touching the workflow\n- `GO_LIVE_LINK_URL` — defaults to https://www.stpetemusic.live/live\n- `FB_PAGE_ID` / `FB_ACCESS_TOKEN`, `IG_USER_ID` / `IG_ACCESS_TOKEN` — already configured\n\n**Not built yet (deferred, see plan):**\n- Threads branch — needs a separate Meta API app product + `THREADS_USER_ID` / `THREADS_ACCESS_TOKEN`\n- Facebook Group posting — dropped, `publish_to_groups` isn't realistically obtainable for this app\n\n**Verify at deploy time:** the Facebook video Stories flow here (`/videos` unpublished → `/video_stories` with `video_id`) and the `link` param on both the FB video story and IG Stories `/media` call — confirm current Graph API behavior for video Stories + link stickers at v24.0 (same version the existing Reels flow uses). This is the least proven part of the workflow; the IG container/wait/status-check/publish chain mirrors the already-working Reels flow in `obsidian-to-youtube-posting.json` closely, the FB video-story side does not have an existing precedent in this codebase to copy.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 660,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [240, -380],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "a1f3c1a0-1000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Threads — planned, not built**\n\nWhen ready: add a branch here mirroring the FB Page Feed post —\n`POST /{THREADS_USER_ID}/threads` (create container) → `POST /{THREADS_USER_ID}/threads_publish`.\n\nNeeds a separate \"Threads API\" app product registered in the Meta App Dashboard (distinct from the standard Graph API app already used for FB/IG) plus new env vars `THREADS_USER_ID` / `THREADS_ACCESS_TOKEN`.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [1300, 900],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "a1f3c1a0-1000-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "Sticky Note (Threads — future)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "go-live",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1f3c1a0-1000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Webhook: Go Live",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [240, 260],
      "webhookId": "go-live"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Validate the shared secret sent by MediaMTX's runOnReady hook (and any other caller).\n// Header lookup is case-insensitive since n8n's webhook node may not normalize keys.\nconst raw = $input.first().json;\nconst headers = raw.headers || {};\nconst headerKey = Object.keys(headers).find((k) => k.toLowerCase() === 'x-n8n-webhook-secret');\nconst provided = headerKey ? headers[headerKey] : undefined;\nconst expected = $env.N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET;\n\nif (!expected || provided !== expected) {\n  throw new Error('[go-live-notify] Invalid or missing X-N8N-Webhook-Secret header');\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: raw.body || raw }];"
      },
      "id": "a1f3c1a0-1000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Verify Webhook Secret",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [500, 260]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Asset and link are env-driven on purpose — swapping the mp4 for a new cut later is a\n// config change (re-upload + update GO_LIVE_ASSET_URL), not a workflow edit.\nconst assetUrl = $env.GO_LIVE_ASSET_URL;\nconst linkUrl = $env.GO_LIVE_LINK_URL || 'https://www.stpetemusic.live/live';\n\nif (!assetUrl) {\n  throw new Error('[go-live-notify] GO_LIVE_ASSET_URL is not set');\n}\n\nconst caption = \"We're live right now! Watch at \" + linkUrl;\n\nreturn [{ json: { assetUrl, linkUrl, caption } }];"
      },
      "id": "a1f3c1a0-1000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Resolve Asset and Link",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [760, 260]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ 'https://graph.facebook.com/v24.0/' + $env.FB_PAGE_ID + '/videos' }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "file_url", "value": "={{ $json.assetUrl }}" },
            { "name": "description", "value": "={{ $json.caption }}" },
            { "name": "access_token", "value": "={{ $env.FB_ACCESS_TOKEN }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1f3c1a0-1000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Post to FB Page Feed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [1020, 60],
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ 'https://graph.facebook.com/v24.0/' + $env.FB_PAGE_ID + '/videos' }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "file_url", "value": "={{ $json.assetUrl }}" },
            { "name": "published", "value": "false" },
            { "name": "access_token", "value": "={{ $env.FB_ACCESS_TOKEN }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1f3c1a0-1000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Create FB Story Video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [1020, 280],
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
